# Split from server.lang - dialogue bundle (aetherhaven_dialogue_miner)
# Full translation keys are aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.<lineKey> (see Hytale I18nModule).
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.root.speaker=Gorruk Stonevein
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.root.body=I plan to dig up stone and ore for the town, but I need a real miner's hut before I can do this properly. I require somewhere dry to sleep and a sturdy workbench. My old crew said you follow the vein, and I still live by that truth. Give me the hut, and I will keep your bins stocked with what the earth offers.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.root.hc0=You wanted to talk about a house.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.root.hc1=Your name is on the registry in a new home like you asked.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.root.hc2=The house is still in progress.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.root.c0=I wanted to check in now that your miner's hut is done.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.root.c1=Your miner's hut is finished. I am here to complete the quest.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.root.c2=Your hut is still under construction. I wanted to ask where things stand.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.root.c3=I want to help you get a miner's hut. Can we start with the plot and token?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.root.c4=That is all for now. I will see you later.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_quest_hut.speaker=Gorruk Stonevein
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_quest_hut.body=Stake a plot for the miner's hut and come find me. Once the hut is up and the bench is in place, I will process what I dig into stone and ore for the town storage, same as we agreed.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_quest_hut.c0=Sure. Give me the token and I'll stake a plot.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_quest_hut.c1=Not right now, I need a bit more time.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_accepted.speaker=Gorruk Stonevein
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_accepted.body=That works for me. When the walls and roof are finished, I will be at the hut workbench so you know exactly where to find me.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_accepted.c0=Understood. I will focus on finishing the build.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_building.speaker=Gorruk Stonevein
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_building.body=The construction sign still shows materials we are missing. Either finish the delivery list or let me know if your plans have changed.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_building.c0=I have to cancel the build. Maybe another time.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_building.c1=I am still working on it and I will keep going.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_abandoned.speaker=Gorruk Stonevein
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_abandoned.body=All right. If that is how it is, so be it. I will be patient.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_abandoned.c0=All right. I will see you around.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_done.speaker=Gorruk Stonevein
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_done.body=Having my own place to work is exactly what I needed. The bench is perfectly stable, and I can get to work immediately. Thank you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_done.c0=Thanks. I will come find you if the town needs more stone or ore.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_house_offer.speaker=Gorruk Stonevein
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_house_offer.body=The work hut is for ore and is really hard to sleep in. I would like a house much like the others receive.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_house_offer.c0=I will stake the house plot and get it built. 
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_house_offer.c1=Another time.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_house_accepted.speaker=Gorruk Stonevein
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_house_accepted.body=When the build is finished, register me on the bookshelf like the charter asks, then come tell me in person.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_house_accepted.c0=You will hear it from me.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_house_remind.speaker=Gorruk Stonevein
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_house_remind.body=Take your time with the frame. When it is standing, put my name on the bookshelf, then come back. I am not rushing you; I just want to be sure.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_house_remind.c0=Understood.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_house_finish.speaker=Gorruk Stonevein
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_house_finish.body=Good. Now Corin won't have to scold me for tracking grit into his inn. Come find me if you need more stone or ores.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gorruk_house_finish.c0=Glad you're happy.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gift.love=This is exactly the kind of material I like to see on a mining bench. I will remember that you brought it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gift.like=That is genuinely useful for what I do out here, so thanks for thinking of me.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gift.neutral=I am not sure what I will use it for yet, but I will stash it and figure something out.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gift.dislike=I work rock and ore, so seeds and garden stuff are not really my thing. Maybe someone at the farm would want that instead.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.fallback=Speak freely. I'm here to help.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.greeting.0=It's rewarding to be able to work with my hands and improve the well-being of this town.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.greeting.1=Dust in the air means hard work is underway. Is there something you need?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.greeting.2=It can get really noisy back here when I'm working, so mind your ears.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.greeting.3=If you bring me ore samples, I can get to work on finding more. Take a look at my stock and order what you need.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.greeting.4=I'm about to head back to the dig site, but I can talk for a moment. How goes it?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.greeting.5=This land has been untouched for so long, the ore practically sings when it's loosed from the earth.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.greeting.6=My boots are dry for once AND you've come to visit. Must be my lucky day.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.greeting.7=Be sure to check my stock regularly. It fills up fast and I will stop digging until someone collects it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.greeting.8=Hello again. Are you here to discuss the secrets of the earth?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.greeting.9=I should ask Lyren about inviting a carter to work in town... oh! I didn't see you there. Can I help you?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.hint.love.0=If you have extra bar stock or clean ore samples, I would gladly take them off of your hands.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.hint.love.1=I notice when someone brings quality tools that help with the dig.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.hint.love.2=Solid armor bits can be used in this line of work. Bring them to me if you would throw them out otherwise.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.hint.love.3=Digging is hard work. I never get enough to eat when I'm at Corin's place.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.hint.love.4=I am always open to donations that make my job easier.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.hint.dislike.0=Someone tried to barter seeds and gardening junk for raw ore. I'm a digger, not a farmer.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.hint.dislike.1=I may seem like an archaeologist, but I am not interested in the remains of those who were here before us.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.hint.dislike.2=If it crumbles into sand, do not offer it like treasure. It is worthless.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.hint.dislike.3=Trash scrap metal with no use here only clutters the floor and would be better off discarded.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.main_hub.hint.dislike.4=I dig up enough stone for the entire town and don't need anyone else to help me keep up supply.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.rep_reward_50.speaker=Gorruk Stonevein
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.rep_reward_100.speaker=Gorruk Stonevein

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.birthday.greeting=Ha. You remembered a miner birthday. That is worth more than ore.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gift.love.birthday=It is my birthday and this gift is wonderful. You made my whole day.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gift.like.birthday=A birthday gift like this. You have good taste.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gift.neutral.birthday=Thanks. A simple gift on my birthday still means a lot.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_miner.gift.dislike.birthday=It is my birthday and you brought that. Well. I still appreciate the thought.
